CURRENTTASK (previous): Real-result settlement (decision 0053) — a slip placed on the
board settles against the fixture's actual final score: won pays the bought
price, a losing leg takes the stake, a push refunds, and a match the feed
hasn't decided yet keeps the slip pending until the result (or a declared
simulation after 12h of silence) — never a hash roll.

